# ABP Data Access

## Supported Providers
- **Entity Framework Core**: Full-featured ORM with migrations
- **MongoDB**: Document database support
- **Dapper**: Lightweight data access

## Key Concepts
- Repository pattern with `IRepository<TEntity, TKey>`
- Unit of Work with `IUnitOfWork`
- Connection string management
- Automatic data filtering (soft delete, multi-tenancy)
- Database provider independence

## Best Practices
- Define repository interfaces in Domain layer
- Implement repositories in EF Core/MongoDB project
- Use `ConfigureByConvention()` for entity configuration
- Don't expose `IQueryable` in public repository interfaces
